    "description": "\ud83d\udcd5 PDF Reader - Viewer & Editor smart and useful document reader\r\n\r\nDiscover the professional reader. You can view, edit and share PDF files easily all in one application.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccb Download PDF Reader - Viewer & Editor now to maximize your work efficiency.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc2 Powerful PDF Viewer\r\nPDF Reader allows you to read PDF files. Navigate pages quickly and easily. Enjoy a seamless reading experience.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc2 Easy PDF editor\r\nYou can highlight, underline and strikethrough notable phrases, draw on PDF files. All easily in one.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc2 PDF Management:\r\nOrganize and manage all PDF files in one place. Help you sort files by: name, file size, time... Rename files, delete PDF files, share PDF quickly.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccc Reading and managing files has never been easier. Download PDF Reader - Viewer & Editor now and experience this convenience.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccb We are still working hard to perfect and develop the application. If there is any problem with the product, please contact us immediately. Thank you for trusting and using PDF Reader - Viewer & Editor!",
